flowchart TB
  IN[Instruction + original file snapshot] --> LLM[LLM proposal<br/>target path + replacement + explanation]
  LLM --> VAL[Validate target and replacement]
  VAL --> DIFF[Built-in side-by-side Diff]
  DIFF --> DEC{User decision}
  DEC -->|Cancel| KEEP[Keep original<br/>source unchanged]
  DEC -->|Approve| RECHECK[Recheck current file state]
  RECHECK --> WRITE[Undoable write + save]
  
  subgraph CONSTRAINTS[Key constraints]
    ONE[One Java file per proposal]
    NOFILE[Generation and preview do not write]
    SNAPSHOT[Full file snapshot for accurate Diff]
  end
